tract filtering into a ReportFilterContext that provides global filter state, per-tab filter overrides, and filter persistence. Filters should apply across tabs where semantically meaningful.\",\"reasoning\":\"When a user filters for 'high confidence' in Findings and switches to Sources, they likely want the same filter. Current isolated state forces redundant filtering. Global filters with per-tab awareness would create a more coherent exploration experience.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:22:32.854Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:22:32.854Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:22:42.206Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01C9QgSTqUoJ7g5GpYHtpHFs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Report Tabs - Insight Synth Complete ✓\n\n**Scan ID:** `dd32d95a-fca9-48fd-8e82-34f582b9e6bd`\n\n**5 Ideas Created:**\n\n1. **Tabs Are Lenses On Same Data, Not Different Data** - All six tabs render projections of SessionWithDetails. Create a Lens abstraction where each tab is defined as a data transformation + renderer, making tabs declarative and composable.\n\n2. **Cards Are Universal Containers With Pluggable Content** - FindingCard, EntityCard, ContradictionCard, etc. all follow the same expand/collapse pattern. Abstract into a UniversalCard with slots for header, badges, body, actions - reduces code by ~60%.\n\n3. **Confidence Is The Unifying Dimension Across All Tabs** - Every tab displays confidence/credibility as isolated metrics. Create a ConfidenceContext that models how source credibility propagates to findings, how contradictions affect entity confidence - making confidence a navigation axis.\n\n4. **Cross-Tab References Create A Knowledge Graph** - The supporting_sources, mention_count, and contradiction references form an implicit graph. Make it explicit with a ReportGraph that enables navigation like \"show all findings from this source.\"\n\n5. **Filter State Is Tab-Specific But Should Be Report-Global** - FindingsTab and SourcesTab manage separate filter states. Extract to ReportFilterContext with global defaults and per-tab overrides - when filtering \"high confidence\" in Findings, Sources should follow.\n\n**Key Observation:** The tabs appear to be separate views but are actually different projections of a unified knowledge structure. The code would benefit from making this underlying unity explicit through shared abstractions for data transformation, card rendering, confidence modeling, and filter state."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3571,"cache_read_input_tokens":99662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3571},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"9152a1f7-6948-4bc1-8795-84f0ee4a4f21"}
